      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْصَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرْصَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَرْصَةُ</span>, <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيح</span> [or
<i>flatus</i>] <i>from which results gibbosity</i> [<i>of the back</i>]
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَدَبُ</span>): (S, M, O, K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَرْسَةُ</span> is a dial. var.
thereof: (M, TA:) or, accord. to A 'Obeyd, the
latter [q. v.] is vulgar. (TA.)

